38.193z" /> </svg></span>Amazon Favorites</a></li></ul></li><li class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-152968"><a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/dog-lifestyle/" class="menu-link">Dog Lifestyle Tips</a></li></ul></div></nav></div></div></div></div></div></header><!-- #masthead --><div id="content" class="site-content"><div class="ast-container"><div class='rttpg-fullwidth-page'> <style> .fp-wrap {
 font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
 color: #2c2c2a;
 }
 /* ── HERO ── */
 .fp-hero {
 background: #faf9f6;
 padding: 80px 48px;
 margin-left: calc(-50vw + 50%);
 margin-right: calc(-50vw + 50%);
 border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e6df;
 }
 .fp-hero-inner {
 max-width: 1100px;
 margin: 0 auto;
 display: flex;
 align-items: center;
 gap: 72px;
 }
 .fp-hero-text {
 flex: 1;
 }
 .fp-hero .fp-eyebrow {
 font-size: 15px;
 letter-spacing: 0.12em;
 text-transform: uppercase;
 color: #15693a;
 margin-bottom: 20px;
 font-weight: 600;
 font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
 display: block;
 }
 .fp-hero h1.fp-hero-heading {
 font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
 font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 80px);
 color: #0c0a09;
 font-weight: 600;
 line-height: 1.1;
 margin: 0 0 20px;
 }
 .fp-hero h1.fp-hero-heading em {
 color: #15693a;
 font-style: normal;
 text-decoration: underline;
 text-decoration-color: #5dcaa5;
 text-decoration-thickness: 4px;
 text-underline-offset: 5px;
 }
 .fp-stat-pills {
 display: flex;
 flex-wrap: nowrap;
 justify-content: flex-start;
 gap: 8px;
 margin-bottom: 20px;
 }
 .fp-pill {
 background: #e1f5ee;
 color: #15693a;
 font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
 font-size: 14px;
 font-weight: 600;
 padding: 5px 14px;
 border-radius: 20px;
 white-space: nowrap;
 }
 @media (max-width: 700px) {
 .fp-pill {
 font-size: 11px;
 padding: 4px 10px;
 }
 .fp-stat-pills {
 gap: 6px;
 justify-content: center;
 }
 }
 .fp-hero .fp-hero-sub {
 font-size: 22px;
 color: #5f5e5a;
 max-width: 480px;
 margin: 0 0 32px;
 line-height: 1.65;
 font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
 }
 .fp-hero-btn {
 display: inline-block;
 background: #15693a;
 color: #ffffff !important;
 font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
 font-size: 20px;
 font-weight: 600;
 text-decoration: none !important;
 padding: 18px 40px;
 border-radius: 8px;
 transition: background 0.2s;
 border-bottom: none !important;
 }
 .fp-hero-btn:hover {
 background: #0d4f2b;
 color: #ffffff !important;
 }
 .fp-hero-img-outer {
 flex-shrink: 0;
 position: relative;
 width: 420px;
 height: 420px;
 }
 .fp-hero-img-wrap {
 position: absolute;
 top: 50px;
 left: 50px;
 right: 50px;
 bottom: 50px;
 border-radius: 50%;
 overflow: hidden;
 border: 6px solid #e1f5ee;
 box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(21, 105, 58, 0.15);
 }
 .fp-spin-badge {
 position: absolute;
 top: 0;
 left: 0;
 width: 100%;
 height: 100%;
 animation: fp-spin 30s linear infinite;
 pointer-events: none;
 }
 @keyframes fp-spin {
 from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
 to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
 }
 .fp-hero-img-wrap img {
 width: 100%;
 height: 100%;
 object-fit: cover;
 display: block;
 }
 @media (max-width: 700px) {
 .fp-hero {
 padding: 36px 20px;
 }
 .fp-hero-inner {
 flex-direction: column;
 text-align: center;
 gap: 24px;
 }
 .fp-hero .fp-hero-sub {
 max-width: 100%;
 margin: 0 auto 24px;
 font-size: 17px;
 }
 .fp-hero h1.fp-hero-heading {
 font-size: clamp(32px, 8vw, 44px);
 margin-bottom: 14px;
 }
 .fp-hero .fp-eyebrow {
 margin-bottom: 12px;
 }
 .fp-hero-btn {
 font-size: 17px;
 padding: 14px 28px;
 }
 .fp-hero-img-outer {
 width: 220px;
 height: 220px;
 margin: 0 auto;
 }
 .fp-hero-img-wrap {
 top: 15px;
 left: 15px;
 right: 15px;
 bottom: 15px;
 }
 }
 /* ── SHARED SECTION STYLES ── */
 .fp-section {
 max-width: 1100px;
 margin: 0 auto;
 padding: 80px 48px 0;
 }
 .fp-section-label {
 font-size: 17px;
 letter-spacing: 0.1em;
 text-transform: uppercase;
 color: #15693a;
 font-weight: 600;
 padding-bottom: 10px;
 border-bottom: 1px solid #d3d1c7;
 margin-bottom: 32px;
 font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
 }
 .fp-text {
 font-size: 22px;
 color: #5f5e5a;
 line-height: 1.75;
 margin-bottom: 20px;
 font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
 }
 .fp-text strong { color: #0c0a09; }
 .fp-text a {
 color: #1e4e8c;
 text-decoration: none;
 border-bottom: 1px solid #b8d0e8;
 transition: color 0.2s;
 }
 .fp-text a:hover { color: #15693a; }
 /* ── NEWSLETTER CTA ── */
 .fp-newsletter {
 background: #e1f5ee;
 border-radius: 14px;
 padding: 64px 56px;
 text-align: center;
 margin: 80px 48px 0;
 max-width: 1100px;
 margin-left: auto;
 margin-right: auto;
 }
 .fp-newsletter .fp-eyebrow {
 font-size: 13px;
 letter-spacing: 0.12em;
 text-transform: uppercase;
 color: #0f6e56;
 margin-bottom: 16px;
 font-weight: 500;
 font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
 }
 .fp-newsletter h2 {
 font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
 font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px);
 font-weight: 600;
 color: #0c0a09;
 line-height: 1.3;
 margin-bottom: 16px;
 }
 .fp-newsletter p {
 font-size: 22px;
 color: #5f5e5a;
 max-width: 520px;
 margin: 0 auto 28px;
 line-height: 1.65;
 font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
 }
 .fp-newsletter p em {
 color: #15693a;
 font-style: normal;
 font-weight: 500;
 }
 .fp-newsletter-btn {
 display: inline-block;
 background: #f78da7;
 color: #0c0a09 !important;
 font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
 font-size: 20px;
