 .fp-flow-arrow{margin:10px 0;transform:rotate(90deg);}
 } </style><div class="fp-wrap"> <!-- ── HERO ── --><div class="fp-hero"><div class="fp-hero-inner"><div class="fp-hero-text"><div class="fp-stat-pills"> <span class="fp-pill">10+ years</span> <span class="fp-pill">2 continents</span> <span class="fp-pill">10,000+ meals prepped</span></div><h1 class="fp-hero-heading">Your Online <em>Raw Dog Food</em> Hub</h1><p class="fp-hero-sub">Real raw meals, practical guidance, and a decade of hands-on experience from my kitchen to yours.</p> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/raw-dog-food-calculator/" class="fp-hero-btn">Here&#8217;s how much raw food your dog needs →</a></div><div class="fp-hero-img-outer"><div class="fp-hero-img-wrap"> <img decoding="async" src="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Homemade-raw-dog-food-with-meat-bone-organs-fish-veggies-and-minerals-transparent.webp" alt="Raw dog food bowl featuring whole fish, chicken wing, organs, green tripe, veggie mix and mineral supplements" width="800" height="800"></div> <svg class="fp-spin-badge" viewBox="0 0 200 200" aria-hidden="true"> <defs> <path id="fp-circle-text" d="M 100,100 m -88,0 a 88,88 0 1,1 176,0 a 88,88 0 1,1 -176,0"></path> </defs> <text font-family="'Source Sans 3', sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="600" fill="#15693a" letter-spacing="3.5"> <textPath href="#fp-circle-text" textLength="553" lengthAdjust="spacing">Raw Fed &#8211; Fit Dogs &#8211; Since 2015 &#8211; K9sOverCoffee &#8211;</textPath> </text> </svg></div></div></div> <!-- ── NEWSLETTER CTA ── --><div class="fp-newsletter"><p class="fp-eyebrow">Free Email Series</p><h2>Want to Make Raw Feeding Easier?</h2><p>Get my 10 balanced raw dog food recipes delivered straight to your inbox &#8211; <em>2 easy, copy-and-paste recipes per day for 5 days.</em> Learn the exact ingredient combos and portion tricks I use to build healthy raw meals.</p> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.kit.com/8073e07fd5" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="fp-newsletter-btn">Yes, Send Me the Raw Dog Food Recipes →</a> <img decoding="async" src="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/How_to_make_your_own_raw_dog_food_recipes-683x1024.webp" alt="Stainless steel bowl with raw dog food ingredients including muscle meat, organ meat, a raw egg with shell, and a furry dehydrated snack" class="fp-newsletter-img" width="683" height="1024"></div> <!-- ── ABOUT ── --><div class="fp-section"><h2 class="fp-section-label">Hi, I&#8217;m Your Host Barbara Rivers</h2><div class="fp-about-row"><div class="fp-about-img-outer"><div class="fp-about-img-wrap"> <img decoding="async" src="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Barbara_resized_blog-683x1024.webp" alt="K9sOverCoffee dog blogger Barbara Rivers showcasing 3 glass dishes filled with raw dog food ingredients" width="683" height="1024"></div><div class="fp-badge fp-badge-fish" title="Raw fish">🐟</div><div class="fp-badge fp-badge-scale" title="Raw meaty bones">🍗</div><div class="fp-badge fp-badge-usflag" title="Raw feeding in the USA">🇺🇸</div><div class="fp-badge fp-badge-deflag" title="Raw feeding in Germany">🇩🇪</div></div><div class="fp-about-body"><p class="fp-text">I&#8217;ve been feeding raw dog food on two continents (US &amp; Europe) since 2015, inspired by my Boxer mixes, Missy and Buzz. After Missy&#8217;s cancer diagnosis and subsequent switch to raw dog food, I promised myself to never feed processed kibble again.</p><p class="fp-text">In 2020, I completed a raw feeding course led by veterinarian Dr. Marion Smart and Labrador breeder Dana Scott, and today I work for one of Germany&#8217;s leading raw dog food brands, BARFER&#8217;S.</p><p class="fp-text">I currently share this journey with Wally, my senior male Feist mix who&#8217;s been raw-fed since he was 1,5 years old. And then there&#8217;s Pepper, my female Labrador, who&#8217;s been raw-fed since she was a 3 month old puppy, showing you raw feeding for every stage of life, messy bowls and all.</p><p class="fp-text">With over a decade of hands-on raw feeding experience, I&#8217;ve helped hundreds of dog owners feed their dogs fresh, species-appropriate meals.</p> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/about-k9sovercoffee-blog/" class="fp-about-cta">Learn more about Barbara and K9sOverCoffee →</a></div></div></div> <!-- ── RAW FEEDING FOR REAL LIFE ── --><div class="fp-section"><h2 class="fp-section-label">Raw Feeding for Real Life With Dogs</h2><p class="fp-text">Raw feeding isn&#8217;t about perfection or rigid rules. It&#8217;s about nourishing your dog with real food that supports digestion, skin, energy, and long-term health, all while fitting into your everyday life.</p><p class="fp-text">On K9sOverCoffee, you&#8217;ll find practical raw dog food guidance alongside real-life dog lifestyle content, so you can feed your dog with confidence and still enjoy life together. There&#8217;s no shame in feeding premade raw dog food if you don&#8217;t have the time or the energy to make your own meals!</p></div> <!-- ── TOPIC CARDS ── --><div class="fp-section"><h2 class="fp-section-label">Where Would You Like to Start?</h2><div class="fp-topics"><div class="fp-topic-card"> <span class="fp-tag">New to Raw?</span><h3>Start Raw Feeding With Confidence</h3><p>Raw feeding isn&#8217;t about perfection &#8211; it&#8217;s about feeding the dog in front of you. A beginner-friendly guide with clarity, confidence, and practical next steps.</p> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/quick-start-guide-to-raw-dog-food/" class="fp-topic-link">Learn how to switch to raw dog food →</a></div><div class="fp-topic-card"> <span class="fp-tag">Sensitivities</span><h3>Raw Feeding for Dogs With Allergies</h3><p>Itching, licking, ear issues, digestive upset: many dogs with food sensitivities do better on fresh, species-appropriate diets. Here&#8217;s a thoughtful approach.</p> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/top-3-reasons-for-dog-allergies-symptoms-and-how-to-cure-them/" class="fp-topic-link">Help your allergic dog →</a></div><div class="fp-topic-card"> <span class="fp-tag">Puppies</span><h3>Raising a Puppy on Raw Food</h3><p>I raised my Labrador puppy Pepper on a raw diet and documented every step along the way &#8211; from feeding percentages to real-life adjustments.</p> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/raw-feeding-labrador-puppy/" class="fp-topic-link">Read Pepper&#8217;s puppy raw feeding series →</a></div></div></div> <!-- ── TESTIMONIALS ── --><div class="fp-testimonials"><div class="fp-testimonials-inner"><h2 class="fp-section-label">Trusted By Raw Feeders Since 2015</h2><p class="fp-text" style="margin-bottom: 28px;">Many of my readers have turned to raw feeding to improve digestion, manage allergies, and support their dogs&#8217; long-term health, and here&#8217;s what some of them have to say.</p><div class="fp-testimonials-grid"><div class="fp-testimonial-card"><div class="fp-testimonial-header"> <img decoding="async" src="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Raw-fed-GSD-Smokey-113x150.webp" alt="Raw-fed German Shepherd Smokey" width="113" height="150"><div><p class="fp-tname">Cheryl Kelly</p><p class="fp-tdog">with Smokey the German Shepherd</p></div></div><blockquote>I was <strong>intimidated</strong> to go with the raw food diet until I happened upon Barbara&#8217;s website. She breaks it all down starting with the <strong>basics</strong> &#8211; the containers used, how she stores them, organizes the freezer, preps the food, labels it, etc. Her recommendations for scales, knives, containers, feeding mats and so much more are all <strong>cost efficient</strong> and easy to obtain. If she recommends it, I buy it. She breaks the meats and misc food down into their categories and why to feed them. Her website gave me enough <strong>confidence</strong> to start with the raw food basics then as my confidence grew, I started to dive down into her website to learn more specifics on certain foods. There&#8217;s nothing you can&#8217;t find or learn from Barbara, her website or her <strong>newsletters</strong>. My <strong>eight month old German Shepherd, Smokey</strong>, has been on the raw food diet for five months now and is <strong>thriving</strong>. I still have a lot to learn but now I have an incredible resource that I <strong>trust and recommend</strong>. She also has some great <strong>discounts</strong> you can continually use at trusted raw food companies.</blockquote></div><div class="fp-testimonial-card fp-testimonial-combo"><div class="fp-testimonial-sub"><div class="fp-testimonial-header"> <img decoding="async" src="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Dogs-archie-yoshi-scaled.webp" alt="Raw-fed senior dog Archie and puppy Yoshi" width="1920" height="1440"><div><p class="fp-tname">Georgia</p><p class="fp-tdog">with Archie &amp; Yoshi</p></div></div><blockquote>Barbara. . . . thank you for the <strong>free calculator</strong>!!! You are <strong>awesome</strong> for doing that!!!! It&#8217;s worth so much more to me but that&#8217;s all I can afford right now. I have a <strong>new puppy</strong> now too. First time I&#8217;ve ever had a small dog. My <strong>big dog loves his new brother</strong>! Again thank you! Georgia</blockquote></div><div class="fp-testimonial-sub"><div class="fp-testimonial-header"> <img decoding="async" src="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/IMG_4918-320x400.webp" alt="Border collie Ranger" width="320" height="400"><div><p class="fp-tname">Juliet</p><p class="fp-tdog">with Ranger the Border Collie</p></div></div><blockquote>New raw feeder and your website has <strong>helped me immensely</strong> in facing the challenge. Thank you for your insightful, informative and thoughtful teachings. I looked and read everywhere and was feeling very afraid and overwhelmed but you gave me the <strong>confidence</strong> to take the plunge for my <strong>border collie</strong>!</blockquote></div></div><div class="fp-testimonial-card"><div class="fp-testimonial-header"> <img decoding="async" src="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/K9sOverCoffee.com-Reader-Haley-with-her-raw-fed-dogs-Annabelle-and-Atlas-150x108.webp" alt="Raw-fed dogs Annabelle and Atlas" width="150" height="108"><div><p class="fp-tname">Annabelle</p><p class="fp-tdog">with Haley &amp; Atlas</p></div></div><blockquote>Barbara saved me so much time from scouring the internet for <strong>raw feeding information</strong>! She&#8217;s incredibly <strong>knowledgeable</strong> and I haven&#8217;t had an easier time with raw feeding than when I read through her blogs because <strong>all you need</strong> is right there. She also <strong>answered any questions</strong> I had, personally, and I&#8217;m so thankful for her!</blockquote></div><div class="fp-testimonial-card"><div class="fp-testimonial-header"> <img decoding="async" src="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/IMG_20240212_100759449-300x400.webp" alt="Dogs Chloe and Peedy" width="300" height="400"><div><p class="fp-tname">Stacey</p><p class="fp-tdog">with Chloe &amp; Peedy</p></div></div><blockquote>Hi Barbara, thank you so much for <strong>addressing my question</strong> on your raw dog food blog! What a treat to have me and my pups discussed in detail with 2 very knowledgeable people! That&#8217;s a first. I <strong>treasure your findings</strong> and all you do for this <strong>community</strong>, I forward everything I can to others in my dog world. Appreciate you and Wally! And your journey in the complex world of <strong>optimal dog nutrition</strong>.</blockquote></div></div></div></div></div> <style> .res-wrap {
