age'> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/raw-feeding-12-month-old-labrador-puppy/" target="_self" rel="bookmark noopener noreferrer" class="uagb-image-ratio-inherit"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="560" height="315" src="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Title-12-month-old-Labrador-puppy-feeding-.webp" class="attachment-large size-large" alt="Black Labrador Pepper lying on the kitchen floor behind a stainless steel slow feeder bowl filled with raw dog food ingredients, with the title &quot;Raw Feeding My 12 Month Old Labrador Puppy: Birthday Edition&quot; and K9sOverCoffee.com" srcset="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Title-12-month-old-Labrador-puppy-feeding-.webp 560w, https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Title-12-month-old-Labrador-puppy-feeding--400x225.webp 400w, https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Title-12-month-old-Labrador-puppy-feeding--150x84.webp 150w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 560px) 100vw, 560px" /> </a></div><h3 class="uagb-post__title uagb-post__text"> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/raw-feeding-12-month-old-labrador-puppy/" target="_self" rel="bookmark noopener noreferrer">Raw Feeding My 12 Month Old Labrador Puppy: Happy Birthday, Pepper!</a></h3><div class='uagb-post__text uagb-post-grid-byline'> <span class="uagb-post__author"> <span class="dashicons-admin-users dashicons"></span> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/author/barbara-rivers/" rel="author">Barbara Rivers</a> </span></div></article><article class="uagb-post__inner-wrap"><div class='uagb-post__image'> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/raw-feeding-11-month-old-labrador-puppy/" target="_self" rel="bookmark noopener noreferrer" class="uagb-image-ratio-inherit"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="560" height="315" src="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Raw-feeding-11-month-old-Labrador-Puppy.webp" class="attachment-large size-large" alt="Wally, a Feist mix, and Pepper, a black Labrador puppy, lying on a wooden floor next to two raw dog food bowls prepared for an 11 month old Labrador puppy, with the title &quot;Raw Feeding My 11 Month Labrador Puppy: More Travels &amp; Diarrhea&quot; and K9sOverCoffee.com" srcset="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Raw-feeding-11-month-old-Labrador-Puppy.webp 560w, https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Raw-feeding-11-month-old-Labrador-Puppy-400x225.webp 400w, https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Raw-feeding-11-month-old-Labrador-Puppy-150x84.webp 150w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 560px) 100vw, 560px" /> </a></div><h3 class="uagb-post__title uagb-post__text"> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/raw-feeding-11-month-old-labrador-puppy/" target="_self" rel="bookmark noopener noreferrer">Raw Feeding My 11 Month Old Labrador Puppy: More Travels &amp; Diarrhea</a></h3><div class='uagb-post__text uagb-post-grid-byline'> <span class="uagb-post__author"> <span class="dashicons-admin-users dashicons"></span> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/author/barbara-rivers/" rel="author">Barbara Rivers</a> </span></div></article><article class="uagb-post__inner-wrap"><div class='uagb-post__image'> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/dog-poop-color-chart/" target="_self" rel="bookmark noopener noreferrer" class="uagb-image-ratio-inherit"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="560" height="315" src="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Dop-poop-color-chart-blog-.webp" class="attachment-large size-large" alt="Dog poop color chart blog header showing brown dog stool on wood chips for raw-fed dogs. Text overlay reads &quot;K9sOVerCoffee.com&quot;" srcset="https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Dop-poop-color-chart-blog-.webp 560w, https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Dop-poop-color-chart-blog--400x225.webp 400w, https://k9sovercoffee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Dop-poop-color-chart-blog--150x84.webp 150w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 560px) 100vw, 560px" /> </a></div><h3 class="uagb-post__title uagb-post__text"> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/dog-poop-color-chart/" target="_self" rel="bookmark noopener noreferrer">Dog Poop Color Chart: What’s Normal for Raw-Fed Dogs?</a></h3><div class='uagb-post__text uagb-post-grid-byline'> <span class="uagb-post__author"> <span class="dashicons-admin-users dashicons"></span> <a href="https://k9sovercoffee.com/author/barbara-rivers/" rel="author">Barbara Rivers</a> </span></div></article></div></div> <!-- CONTENT END 1 --></div></div> <!-- ast-container --></div><!-- #content --><footer
class="site-footer" id="colophon" itemtype="https://schema.org/WPFooter" itemscope="itemscope" itemid="#colophon"><div class="site-above-footer-wrap ast-builder-grid-row-container site-footer-focus-item ast-builder-grid-row-2-equal ast-builder-grid-row-tablet-2-equal ast-builder-grid-row-mobile-full ast-footer-row-stack ast-footer-row-tablet-stack ast-footer-row-mobile-stack" data-section="section-above-footer-builder"><div class="ast-builder-grid-row-container-inner"><div class="ast-builder-footer-grid-columns site-above-footer-inner-wrap ast-builder-grid-row"><div class="site-footer-above-section-1 site-footer-section site-footer-section-1"><aside role="region"
 class="footer-widget-area widget-area site-footer-focus-item footer-widget-area-inner" data-section="sidebar-widgets-footer-widget-7"				><section id="block-150" class="widget widget_block"><style> .k9-footer-widget {
 font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
 color: #5f5e5a;
 font-size: 18px;
 line-height: 1.7;
 text-align: left;
 padding: 0 20px;
}
.k9-footer-widget a {
 color: #1e4e8c;
 text-decoration: none;
 border-bottom: 1px solid #b8d0e8;
 transition: color 0.2s;
}
.k9-footer-widget a:hover {
 color: #15693a;
}
.k9-footer-note {
 font-size: 16px;
 color: #8a8a85;
 margin-top: 10px;
 font-style: italic;
} </style><div class="k9-footer-widget"><h3>Therapeutic Diet Disclosure</h3><p>As much as I'd love to assist, I'm not a vet, so I'm unable to share therapeutic diets for specific conditions. For personalized guidance, I recommend reaching out to a <a href="https://www.ahvma.org/find-a-holistic-veterinarian/#!directory/map/ord=lnm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">holistic veterinarian</a> who can tailor your pup's diet accordingly.</p><p class="k9-footer-note">Raw feeding consultations will be available in 2027, once I'm certified through <a href="https://www.thp-schule.de/barf-berater-ausbildung/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">THP School</a> in Germany.</p></div></section></aside></div><div class="site-footer-above-section-2 site-footer-section site-footer-section-2"><aside role="region"
 class="footer-widget-area widget-area site-footer-focus-item footer-widget-area-inner" data-section="sidebar-widgets-footer-widget-8"				><section id="block-151" class="widget widget_block"><div class="k9-footer-widget"><h3 style="white-space: nowrap;">How to Support K9sOverCoffee</h3><p>K9sOverCoffee is open to everyone without a paywall because I believe that healthy dog lifestyle knowledge, especially the raw feeding part, should be a public good. That said, your financial support helps keep K9sOverCoffee running.</p><p><a href="https://k9sovercoffee.kit.com/products/tip-jar" target="_blank" rel="noopener">You can support my work by adding as little as $5.00 here</a>!</p></div></section></aside></div></div></div></div><div class="site-primary-footer-wrap ast-builder-grid-row-container site-footer-focus-item ast-builder-grid-row-full ast-builder-grid-row-tablet-full ast-builder-grid-row-mobile-full ast-footer-row-inline ast-footer-row-tablet-stack ast-footer-row-mobile-stack" data-section="section-primary-footer-builder"><div class="ast-builder-grid-row-container-inner"><div class="ast-builder-footer-grid-columns site-primary-footer-inner-wrap ast-builder-grid-row"><div class="site-footer-primary-section-1 site-footer-section site-footer-section-1"><aside
 class="footer-widget-area widget-area site-footer-focus-item footer-widget-area-inner" data-section="sidebar-widgets-footer-widget-1" aria-label="Footer Widget 1" role="region"				><section id="block-156" class="widget widget_block"><style> .k9ft {
